    "The {area} processing team experiences {pct}% annual turnover, significantly exceeding the organizational average and benchmarks reported by comparable functions at peer organizations. Exit interview data consistently identifies process complexity, inadequate tooling, and the absence of professional development pathways as primary drivers of attrition — factors that compound into a recruiting and retention cost estimated at ${cost}K annually.",
    "ACPWB's {area} process has not been subject to a formal process capability assessment in {years} years, leaving leadership without objective evidence of where the function stands relative to industry benchmarks or its own historical performance trajectory. This measurement gap makes it impossible to build a credible business case for improvement investment or to set defensible performance targets.",
