    "ACPWB's {area} process currently produces {count} separate output formats consumed by {dept_count} downstream functions, none rationalized against actual consumption requirements. An estimated {pct}% of output fields are never used by any downstream consumer, yet continue to be generated and quality-checked as though they carry genuine analytical value.",
    "A structured review of {area} process inputs found that {count} data elements currently collected during intake are collected exclusively to satisfy requirements from a legacy system decommissioned in {old_year}. These data elements continue to be collected, stored, and periodically reconciled at a cost of {hours} FTE-hours monthly, providing no value to current processing requirements or regulatory obligations.",
    "ACPWB's {area} function maintains no formal inventory of the manual controls exercised by processing staff during transaction review. Internal Audit has noted in {count} consecutive annual management letters that this control documentation gap prevents effective testing and creates reliance on individual judgment that may not be consistently applied.",
