    "A detailed workflow analysis of {area} found that {pct}% of handler time is spent waiting for system responses, file loads, and batch job completions rather than performing substantive processing activities. This system-induced idle time is a direct product of aging infrastructure and poorly optimized processing routines that have not been tuned since implementation in {old_year}.",
    "The {area} function maintains separate record-keeping systems for regulatory purposes and for operational management, with no automated synchronization between them. Maintaining records in parallel increases administrative overhead, creates reconciliation risk, and produces situations where information received by regulators contradicts what operational leadership believes to be true.",
